flowchart TB
    Transform["Transform"] -->|owns| TransformResponsibilities["Source-representation admission<br/>Representation normalization<br/>Canonical-graph serialization"]

    LiveMap["LiveMap"] -->|owns| LiveMapResponsibilities["Canonical graph state<br/>Revisioned mutation<br/>Authoritative graph-change emission"]

    Reflection["Reflection"] -->|coordinates| ReflectionResponsibilities["Canonical-change-to-runtime projection<br/>Authoritative-state-to-runtime correspondence"]

    LiveTree["LiveTree"] -->|owns| LiveTreeResponsibilities["Graph-state realization<br/>DOM, CSS, events, and runtime projection"]

    Locus["Locus"] -->|governs around one LiveMap| LocusResponsibilities["Exclusive authority boundary<br/>Ordering and authorization<br/>Sessions, recovery, and publication"]

    LiveHost["LiveHost"] -->|provides| LiveHostResponsibilities["Application/runtime hosting boundary<br/>Routing and optional residency infrastructure<br/>No canonical graph authority"]
